","logical_entry_identity":"0af66805b821b29c1384cb229098965bfb5f84ceecf67a1cdd9a72a51ebd96ae","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"+Snipe","source_tag":"_t","target":"+狙击"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"fc78a2d096b1394c602ccf8d89143d836d89044be4395bdb0173e6482e6f6a71","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"d43364dc259b4ac335fa641f5e23cb59d27a4f76a9b5413cdb871c4f92bf5747","logical_entry_identity":"5529ed2ffe60931106b25fab332b4d3c9585920be2ade2f88fa3e4d9329a547b","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"This strange globe of blue light seems to be alive and asleep. Nothing about it moves, yet you can feel the crushing power of its dreams assaulting your mind.","source_tag":"_t","target":"这个奇怪的发光球体似乎是活的，而且正在熟睡。不过，尽管它还没有移动，你已经感受到它梦境的力量在冲击自己的精神。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"9bd201cf84ba99c671f55a0a5cf831173fba9b2ef6e42a825099af3a8ab1e0a8","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"d437b74813750c6cf9e2ac38079756c26de56188c51719bbaf1b4c65910cec39","logical_entry_identity":"f4f99e45a60eff05f9abf3712edce4aa75572405790c88aa68eaa49b381fb1d7","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Projects up to %d attacks dealing 30%% weapon damage to other random targets in range 7 as mind damage (1/turn)","source_tag":"tformat","target":"朝周围7格范围内随机目标投射至多 %d 次攻击，每次造成 30%% 精神武器伤害（1次/回合）"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"d31a2f0ff1c85ad6e3f18ffa1d0d800268793b36f9d2b1a0745b14afdb7b771e","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"d43a349793564e9ca7357c50a1df8dfd85ad35f95cfd03ce9bf7ca90a1738208","logical_entry_identity":"f9e0e25cb80b814fba2a8e83d67ac3ed15f4d30320d5ad691d9bb0883a48741b","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"You go all out, trying to burn down your foes as fast as possible.\n\t\tYou gain +%d%% attack speed, +%d%% critical chance and +%d%% physical resistance penetration, but this talent drains 6 stamina each turn.\n\t\tThis effect is disabled automatically on rest or run.\n\t\t","source_tag":"tformat","target":"你疯狂地杀戮，试图尽快击倒你的敌人。\n\t\t增加 %d%% 攻击速度，%d%% 暴击率和 %d%% 物理抗性穿透，每回合消耗 6 点体力。\n\t\t该效果在休息或者奔跑时自动解除。\n\t\t"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"e7e64d3bea8d07dfe5d9ecc1eddd4f8c3fa141184eb77034d62104851235d0ab","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"d43a38181cdbe3776733e258afa98f318b71e151cf5d08ddec49d4d08c526947","logical_entry_identity":"53aa073b587fcb075617daa7a31ee272a8a7c310b0921ad7ddbb993bc62daf6f","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Thrall","source_tag":"_t","target":"奴仆"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"f78ebecd2e93af6fb5c9be7e27c49568bf1ed9bb74ebf47571eeff4b6136e7ed","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"d43a5e1bea2d36e80310b283292dcd7a4c3e2b4ea9470735923ca0ec5c63416c","logical_entry_identity":"638e48799e50689f9cc81ad3b6f3b51bd5712b66436c7759debce6e7cbf910f5","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"You must be near the moonstone to summon Limmir.","source_tag":"logPlayer","target":"你必须在月亮石附近召唤利米尔。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"87a43100eed81af1b92bd54706795079c663e80e6fcab295c071f988fdb276f1","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"d43a686de4bf51f10a8d53761d106e4593fa0d0c5e61fff211dcd3970bf9949b","logical_entry_identity":"89ccb9ac7b35738a62dffd9925d32c396a594d5f2d778263a6deac057700f86a","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#LIGHT_BLUE#Offhand%s","source_tag":"tformat","target":"#LIGHT_BLUE#副手%s"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"56b6e9fd832f1a1796899ebb7c08d03a3527ad86d51f20fbae0055494339e019","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"d43f4bcf745116b25cee279999ca4d986d8c0f15e4a0505c2509dbc1fb22236b","logical_entry_identity":"89b6caa66cda79526f748058cd2ae1eeb14b77303cd6b60e8bf80eef353b2371","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#{bold}#Journal Entry I#{normal}#\n\nIt's been some time since High Sun Paladin Aeryn sent me out on an assignment. According to recent intelligence, it would seem that a cavern has mysteriously emerged near our outpost, the Gates of Morning. They have bestowed the name \"Ardhungol\" on the newly discovered cavern. The elder warriors seem anxious in regards to the origin of this new subterranean area; they're likely concerned that the orcs are using Ardhungol as a staging point for further aggression against the Gates of Morning. I'll have to make sure I'm well equipped for this journey; the fate of us all could hang in the balance.\n\n#{bold}#Journal Entry II#{normal}#\n\nI spoke with the border patrols tonight. There seem to have been several sightings of orcs and other wild beasts roaming throughout the wilderness, yet strangely enough, none seem to have been anywhere near Ardhungol. Perhaps the subterranean cavern was simply a natural phenomenon with unfortunate timing. It's either that, or an unknown force powerful enough to alter the very foundation of the land upon its arrival. I shudder at the latter thought, but for now this is all merely speculation. If all goes well, I'll be ready to depart by dawn.\n","source_tag":"_t","target":"#{bold}#第一篇#{normal}#\n\n高阶太阳骑士艾琳派我外出执行任务已有一段时间。根据最近的情报，我们的前哨晨曦之门附近似乎神秘地出现了一座洞穴。人们将这座新发现的洞穴命名为“阿尔德胡格”。资深战士们似乎对这片新地下区域的来源忧心忡忡；他们可能担心兽人正把阿尔德胡格当作进一步侵犯晨曦之门的前进基地。我必须确保自己为此行配备齐全；我们所有人的命运都可能取决于此。\n\n#{bold}#第二篇#{normal}#\n\n今晚我与边境巡逻队交谈过。荒野中似乎数次有人目击兽人与其他野兽四处游荡，但奇怪的是，它们似乎都没有靠近阿尔德胡格。也许这座地下洞穴只是出现得不是时候的自然现象。要么如此，要么有一股未知力量到来，而它强大得足以改变大地的根基。想到后一种可能，我不寒而栗，但目前这一切都只是推测。如果一切顺利，到黎明时我就能做好出发准备。\n"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"945ba7304a1cc923a97ae35095366be2d9291321cb26ea1634318875fc7747b9","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"d449f44542e3245b3b7d1c175c6218ac23abb627bfeb314db238f7a653071835","logical_entry_identity":"9286cc342ddc3b477700cf16f9629db081f115180e5fe0925f2b5c3e0958ea7f","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"rotten stone limb","source_tag":"_t","target":"腐烂的石化肢体"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"9935ced4ab60867f819e26e7bf810fd99900a6a9266fdc97ea3b9d93aef1b5c2","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"d44d0a4223bc307863c769dbedf706a5317ebfc06d9260338df2247c4cddeab9","logical_entry_identity":"5b426e09c390236816d6608d3ee